    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201601311/2016013110080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016013110090,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "その黒糖アイスも、\r\nひと口いただけません……？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201601311/2016013110090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、もちろん構わないぞ\r\nひと口と言わず、ふた口三口取っていってくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016013110100,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "わ、甘やかされてる……\r\n油断してると、全部食べちゃいますよ？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201601311/2016013110100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ははっ、いいよ\r\n千雪が欲しいだけ食べてくれて",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016013110110,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "もう……冗談です！\r\n大切に、一口だけもらっちゃいます。……えいっ",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
